    "body": "I don't think it is possible to use binary value. Currently starship is using STARSHIP_SHELL to determine shell and using binary variable instead of it will make impossible(maybe difficult) to determine which shell starship prompt is running. Using both PRINT_SHELL_ESCAPE and STARSHIP_SHELL for printing may be good solution if implemented using solution 1 technique.",
