    "body": "I can confirm this issue has leaked into other usage as well (it works fine with ZSH, however), with Fish I experience the following:\r\n\r\n```\r\n%{%}~%{%} via %{%}⬢ %{%}%{%}v12.8.1%{%} via %{%}🦀 %{%}%{%}v1.37.0%{%} via %{%}🐍 %{%}%{%}v2.7.16%{%}\r\n%{%}❯%{%}\r\n```\r\n\r\nLine in my `.config/fish/config.fish:\r\n\r\n```fish\r\neval (starship init fish)\r\n```\r\n\r\nEnvironment information (starship installed with Homebrew):\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ fish --version\r\nfish, version 3.0.2\r\n\r\n$ starship --version\r\nstarship 0.11.0\r\n\r\n$ uname -a\r\nDarwin HOSTNAME.local 18.7.0 Darwin Kernel Version 18.7.0: Thu Jun 20 18:42:21 PDT 2019; root:xnu-4903.270.47~4/RELEASE_X86_64 x86_64\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
